  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@scienceingang\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/@scienceingang</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"계숙 샘\" data-og-description=\"과학이 따뜻해지는 공간, 과학인강에 오신 걸 환영해요! 함께 배우고 성장하는 과학 교실입니다. (채널명이 ‘계숙샘’에서 **‘과학인강’**으로 바뀌었어요. 과학 채널이라는 특성이 더 잘 드\" data-og-host=\"www.youtube.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/@scienceingang\" data-og-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm80Z58LDqbqRQAmEmMQuxQ\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/czuAbA/hyZMRBjdNy/cX5HjKZqbz5OOZRZ1BN1a1/img.jpg?width=900&amp;height=900&amp;face=215_208_368_375,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ezXWf/hyZMNZZj3K/WkLOF4Q33KGLS7qaFJ1Lg0/img.jpg?width=900&amp;height=900&amp;face=215_208_368_375\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@scienceingang\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/@scienceingang\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/czuAbA/hyZMRBjdNy/cX5HjKZqbz5OOZRZ1BN1a1/img.jpg?width=900&amp;height=900&amp;face=215_208_368_375,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ezXWf/hyZMNZZj3K/WkLOF4Q33KGLS7qaFJ1Lg0/img.jpg?width=900&amp;height=900&amp;face=215_208_368_375\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">계숙 샘</p><p class=\"og-desc\">과학이 따뜻해지는 공간, 과학인강에 오신 걸 환영해요! 함께 배우고 성장하는 과학 교실입니다. (채널명이 ‘계숙샘’에서 **‘과학인강’**으로 바뀌었어요. 과학 채널이라는 특성이 더 잘 드</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.youtube.com</p></div></a></div><p>우연히 검색하다가 알게 되었는데요.</p><p>영상들이 설명과 아주 적절한 그래픽 자료들을 제공해서</p><p>이해가 쏙쏙 됩니다~&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8fc8495e05f39432d53483eb06904f072532ca4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8fc8495e05f39432d53483eb06904f072532ca4\" data-origin-width=\"392\" data-origin-height=\"439\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>질문)</p><p>&#160; &#39;계숙 샘&#39; 은 누구실까요? 저희 재과만 회원일까요? ~</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
